contact=f'''<section class="page-hero dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</div><h1>Tell us what<br><span class="light">you have in mind.</span></h1><p>A process to understand. A system to improve. An idea to explore. A short introduction is a good place to start.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div class="contact-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Let’s make it practical</div><h2>A little context<br>goes a long way.</h2><p>Tell Juliet what you are working on, the challenge you want to solve and what a useful outcome would look like.</p><a href="mailto:{EMAIL}">{EMAIL}</a><div class="note">Prefer a direct email? Use the address above. The form prepares a draft for you to review and send through your own email app.</div><div class="founder-name"><div class="initials" aria-hidden="true">JU</div><div><strong>Juliet Ihuoma Uzoeshi</strong><span>Chesterfield, United Kingdom</span></div></div></div><form class="contact-form" id="enquiry-form"><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Full name"></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email address</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="180" placeholder="you@company.com"></div></div><div class="field"><label for="company">Company <span>· optional</span></label><input id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="160" placeholder="Your organisation"></div><div class="field"><label for="interest">What would you like to discuss?</label><select id="interest" name="interest">{''.join('<option>'+escape(i)+'</option>' for i in interests)}</select></div><div class="field"><label for="message">Tell us about it</label><textarea id="message" name="message" required minlength="10" maxlength="3500" placeholder="The challenge, your current setup and what you would like to achieve…"></textarea></div><button class="btn btn-dark" id="prepare-enquiry" type="submit" disabled>Prepare my enquiry {ARROW}</button><p class="form-hint">Nothing is sent automatically. You can review your draft before opening your email app. <a href="privacy.html">Privacy details</a>.</p><noscript><p class="note">Email your enquiry directly to <a href="mailto:{EMAIL}">{EMAIL}</a>. The draft builder needs JavaScript.</p></noscript><section class="draft-result" id="draft-result" hidden><h3 id="draft-title" tabindex="-1">Your enquiry is ready.</h3><pre id="draft-preview"></pre><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-dark" id="open-draft" href="mailto:{EMAIL}">Open email app {ARROW}</a><button class="btn btn-outline-light" id="copy-draft" type="button">Copy draft</button></div><p class="copy-status" id="draft-status" role="status"></p></section></form></div></section>'''
page('contact.html','Discuss your engineering project','Contact Juliet at SmartOpsTech about industrial automation, applied AI, software, research or learning.',contact)

privacy=f'''<section class="page-hero dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Website information</div><h1>Your enquiry.<br><span class="light">Your choice.</span></h1></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap reading privacy-list"><h2>Using the enquiry form</h2><p>The enquiry form builds an email draft in your browser. It does not submit your details to a SmartOpsTech database. You choose whether to copy the text or open your email app, and you send the email yourself.</p><h2>Email correspondence</h2><p>If you send an enquiry to {EMAIL}, its contents are received through the email service used for that address and can be used to respond to you. Avoid including sensitive plant credentials, passwords or confidential documents in an initial enquiry.</p><h2>Website delivery</h2><p>This website is hosted on Vercel. The hosting provider may process technical information needed to deliver and secure the site, such as request and network information. This version of the site does not add analytics trackers or advertising cookies.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>GitHub, LinkedIn and ResearchGate links open external services with their own privacy practices. The website’s interactive process demo uses example data in your browser and does not connect to a live industrial system.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about an enquiry you have sent, contact <a href="mailto:{EMAIL}">{EMAIL}</a>.</p></div></section>'''
page('privacy.html','Privacy & enquiry information','How the SmartOpsTech enquiry draft and website work.',privacy)
